	(text "eFuse setting pins:\nC103 on DVDT: output turn-on slew,\n  ~5.5 ms ramp to 5 V (limits inrush).\nR106 on ILM: current limit, 2.22 A\n  (R = 3334 / I).\nC104 on ITIMER, DNP: overcurrent blanking\n  timer (how long current may exceed the\n  limit before the eFuse acts). Open =\n  shortest. Fit ~1 nF (~0.84 ms) if normal\n  load steps trip the limit (FAULT pulses\n  at bring-up)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bc088cb7-cd46-4d62-89fc-43f2473abd20"))
